    <h1 data-reveal style="transition-delay:.05s">I&rsquo;m Daniel.</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.12s">And I don&rsquo;t have this figured out.</p>
    <p class="body" data-reveal style="transition-delay:0.18s">I&rsquo;m a husband, a father, a Christian, and the person behind The Narrow Road Home.</p>
    
  </div>
